Third-party binaries bundled in the desktop installer (resources/ffmpeg/):

- FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), static build "ffmpeg version 6.1.1-essentials_build-www.gyan.dev"
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3 (see resources/ffmpeg/<platform>/LICENSE.txt).
  It is distributed as an unmodified, separate executable invoked via command line for
  RTMP → HTTP-FLV live-camera transcoding and AI camera frame capture. Corresponding source
  code is available from https://ffmpeg.org/download.html and https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/.
  Builds are fetched by scripts/desktop/fetch-ffmpeg.mjs; an LGPL build can be substituted by
  pointing DESKTOP_FFMPEG_MIRROR / STRAVISION_FFMPEG_PATH at it.

